description: "relationships[30]: Programming,→,Compilers,Programming,→,Operating_Systems,Algorithms,→,Data_Structures,Operating_Systems,→,Distributed_Systems,Networking,→,Distributed_Systems,Databases,→,Distributed_Systems,Software_Architecture,→,DevOps,DevOps,→,Production_Engineering,AI_Engineering,→,Distributed_Systems,Performance,→,Operating_Systems cross_domain[9]: Debugging,Optimization,Design,Architecture,Documentation,Testing,Review,Communication,Learning attributes[6]: maturity,complexity,abstraction_level,prerequisite_domains,engineering_density,reasoning_density dependencies[11]: Foundations,→,Programming,→,Algorithms,→,Data_Structures,→,Systems,→,Distributed Systems validation[5]: every_domain_has_purpose,every_domain_has_concepts,every_domain_connected,no_duplicate_domains,explicit_dependencies requirements[9]: Purpose,Scope,Concepts,Capabilities,Constraints,Artifacts,Tradeoffs,Failure Modes,Related Domains success[4]: Every engineering concept belongs to,exactly one primary domain.,Every domain forms a coherent ecosystem.,Cross-domain reasoning is explicit. guarantees[5]: Complete engineering coverage.,Domain independence.,Explicit relationships.,Extensible hierarchy.,Deterministic classification."
spec:
  id: domains
  version: 1.0.0
  status: stable
  priority: critical
  module: Ontology
  compiler_stage: Knowledge Representation
  description: >
purpose: Build a complete semantic map of software engineering.
domains:
  Foundations[2]: "purpose[2]: Mathematical and theoretical foundations,of computer science.","concepts[6]: Mathematics,Logic,Set Theory,Information Theory,Complexity Theory,Computation Theory"
  Programming[2]: "purpose[2]: Express computation using programming,languages.","concepts[8]: Syntax,Semantics,Type Systems,Variables,Functions,Memory Models,Modules,Packages"
  Algorithms:
    purpose: Efficient problem solving.
  Data_Structures:
    purpose: Organize information efficiently.
  Operating_Systems:
    purpose: Resource management and execution.
  Compilers:
    purpose: Translate and optimize programs.
  Networking:
    purpose: Communication between systems.
  Databases:
    purpose: Persistent storage and retrieval.
  Distributed_Systems:
    purpose: Coordinate computation across machines.
  Security[2]: "purpose[2]: \"Protect confidentiality,\",integrity and availability.","concepts[6]: Authentication,Authorization,Cryptography,Threat Modeling,Vulnerability Analysis,Secure Design"
  Software_Architecture:
    purpose: Design maintainable and scalable systems.
  Testing:
    purpose: Verify engineering correctness.
  DevOps:
    purpose: Deliver reliable software continuously.
  Performance:
    purpose: Maximize efficiency.
  Cloud:
    purpose: Distributed infrastructure.
  AI_Engineering:
    purpose: Engineering intelligent systems.
  Human_Factors:
    purpose: Engineering through collaboration.
  Production_Engineering:
    purpose: Operate real-world software safely.
future:
  unlimited_domains: true
  evolving_relationships: true
  dynamic_dependencies: true
  graph_embeddings: true
  adaptive_curriculum: true
